@startuml use-case-diagram
title Smart Campus - Room Booking (Use Case Diagram)
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor Student
actor Administrator

rectangle "Smart Campus Room Booking System" {
    usecase "View room availability" as UC_View
  usecase "Book room" as UC_Book
  usecase "Cancel own booking" as UC_Cancel
  usecase "Block room" as UC_Block
  usecase "Unblock room" as UC_Unblock
  usecase "Review room usage" as UC_Review
}

' Student goals
Student -- UC_View
Student -- UC_Book
Student -- UC_Cancel

' Administrator goals
UC_Block -- Administrator
UC_Unblock -- Administrator
UC_Review -- Administrator

note bottom of UC_Book
  R1: future start, 0 < duration <= 2 h
  R2: no overlap with active bookings for the room
      A1: touching bookings (12:00 end, 12:00 start)
      do NOT overlap - end time is exclusive
  R3: room must not be blocked
  R4: success produces a confirmation
end note

note bottom of UC_Cancel
  R2: cancelled booking is no longer active,
  so the slot is free for others
end note

note bottom of UC_Block
  R3: blocked room accepts no new bookings
  A2: existing bookings on the room are kept
end note

@enduml